# Code owners for peristyle-ai/harness.
#
# One owner: the repository's owner account. A pull request that changes
# anything needs an approval from this account before it can merge.
#
# WHY THIS IS THE ONLY LINE: the agents propose changes
# through pull requests that are opened by a GitHub Actions workflow
# using the repository's own GITHUB_TOKEN -- so the PR author is
# `github-actions[bot]`, NOT the Peristyle account. The bot cannot
# approve its own pull request, and it is not a code owner, so an
# agent's pull request can only ever be approved and merged by that
# account.
#
# The agents therefore cannot merge their own work, and cannot push to
# main at all (branch protection allows no direct pushes).
* @peristyle-ai
